# Glow Control – Backend Monorepo

## 📖 README Index

- ](RndeondllMs/Rter API](src/routers/control/README.md)
- [Helper Scripts](scripts/README.md)
- [Weekly Report Generator](src/reports/README.md)

End-to-end infrastructure for off-chain purchasing of GCTL tokens with on-chain USDC transfers.

> Each component provides **at-least-once** delivery with idempotent database writes. A transfer therefore progresses exactly once or surfaces an explicit error—never lost in limbo.

---

## Repository Layout

| Path                  | Description                                                                                                                |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `src/index.ts`        | Elysia HTTP server (port 3000) – registers the purchase router and exposes Swagger docs.                                   |
| `src/routers/control` | Core control logic: transfer validation, balance endpoint, staking functionality _(see docs)_.                             |
| `src/jobs`            | BullMQ queues + workers (purchase confirmation **and** block-finality checks) _(see README inside)_.                       |
| `ponder/`             | Ponder blockchain indexer **and** `src/poller.ts` which bridges on-chain events to the purchase API _(see README inside)_. |
| `src/db`              | Drizzle schema shared by all components.                                                                                   |
| `src/utils`           | Decimal-safe helpers for BigInt ↔︎ human conversions.                                                                      |
| `src/reports`         | Weekly statistics report generator uploaded to R2 storage.                                                                 |

